            "review_title": "Review at Sol Kitchen & Bar District 7",
            "review_text": "Nikola M\n3 contributions\n0\nNot family friendly\nApr 2023\nWe finally arrived in Vietnam- for the first time with our kids and took off for a drink and bite somewhere nice and had been keen to try this place before coming to the country- we finally arrive only to be told no kids are allowed. I never saw this anywhere on the website- not even just for dinner let alone any drinks or to swim in the pool. My girls and ourselves were guttered- usually feel very welcome everywhere but this was a huge bummer. Maybe mention it so people don’t waste their time\nRead more\nWritten May 11, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
