            "review_title": "Review at Sol Kitchen & Bar District 7",
            "review_text": "Leean W\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam206 contributions\n0\nBeautiful Setting\nSep 2022\nWe have been to Sol quite a few times, mainly because of the very good service and beautiful setting. Sitting in a cabana with friends, looking at the gorgeous pool and bar at the far end you genuinely feel that you are in a high end resort. The cocktails and wine are very pleasant and normally I order the Peruvian roast chicken and a garden salad. The chicken is well cooked and delicious although rather small, but the salad is around the size you would expect. Everyone of our group that we have ever gone to Sol with has enjoyed their meal. Disappointed though quite recently when I wanted to book cabanas for 34 people for a special birthday. I was asked to pay a deposit, which was fine because I was told it would be deducted from my bill on the day, but then I was informed that a new policy had just been made where I have to guarantee that everyone would spend at least a million per person. To be honest I didn't feel I could ask my guests to do that as although some would spend around 600- 700 vnd, others would spend a couple of million, so I felt that it would even out. I calculated between us we would pay equivalent to at least 1500 usd and asked the lady taking the booking if she could ask the manager to consider waiving the minimum 1 million spend per person given what I felt was quite an accurate estimate of what we would pay anyway. The lady took my mobile number but no one ever called sadly, as I really had wanted the celebration to take place there. I have been there a few times since, and always there is first class service and a great ambience, but we all go in small groups now to avoid the minimum 1 mill spend and to just order and pay for what we like. But the place itself and the staff etc will not disappoint.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 16, 2022",
