            "review_text": "Erin G\n20 contributions\n0\nA MUST IN SAIGON! AMAZING FOOD/VENUE\nMay 2021 • Friends\nI visited Sol district 7 for a friends birthday and had the best time. The dishes are like tapas style so we got a few to share. The beef cheeks were so tender, the whipped goats cheese was to die for. Everything we ordered exceeded expectations and just kept getting better with each bite.\n\nThe restaurant is nothing less than beautiful, with a massive swimming pool, cabanas and a lovely dining area. It feels like a beach club, even though you’re in the city. The perfect place for a birthday or cocktails and tapas. \n\nOur server was delightful and so attentive, no one ever had an empty wine glass.\n\nThe manager and owners were lovely and made sure we were enjoying our meal and experience.\n\nSol d7 is such a unique addition to Saigon and it’s like nothing else in the city. I absolutely can’t wait to go back. 11/10 recommend.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 1, 2021",
