            "review_text": "Tayla D\n6 contributions\n1\nLockdown Delivery\nJul 2021 • Couples\nIf you are in the mood for gourmet, fine dining with maximum portions, delivered straight to your door step for affordable prices check out Sol Kitchen & Bar D7. My partner and I were blown away by the 100k appreciation daily special menu which was a lamb kofta and a truffle cheese burger. Both proteins were cooked to perfection with the perfect amount of relish and fries accompanying them. We love any and all types of dips so wanted to give the Eggplant miso dip a try and it did not disappoint. Incredible amount of flavor and the perfect consistency. All these dishes travelled extremely well and free delivery is applied within district 7 for deliveries which are over 500k. Give them a try for a lockdown lunch treat - you won’t regret it 😍\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 1, 2021",
